<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — BodyDefs for species needing a non-vanilla
  body. Anooba's custom `Anooba` BodyDef needed only a defName rename (its
  part composition is entirely vanilla Core parts — Tail, Spine, Stomach,
  Heart, Lung x2, Kidney x2, Liver, Neck/Head/Skull/Brain/Eye x2/Ear x2/Nose/
  AnimalJaw, 4x Leg/Paw), ported here as RSW_Anooba for the same reason (its
  ThingDef's <race><body> points at it). Bolotaur uses the vanilla Core
  `QuadrupedAnimalWithClawsTailAndJowl` body and needs no port at all.

  Ported verbatim from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's
  Bodies/Bodies_Animal_StarWars.xml. Beldon's 3 tentacle parts reuse the
  ALREADY-PORTED (Wave B, RSW_MlieWaveB_BodyParts.xml) custom BodyPartDefs
  (RSW_SW_LeftTentacle, RSW_SW_RightTentacle, RSW_SW_DorsalTentacle) and
  BodyPartGroupDefs (RSW_SWTentacleAttackTool, RSW_SW_FirstTentacleBeldon,
  RSW_SW_SecondTentacleBeldon, RSW_SW_ThirdTentacleBeldon) — no new body part
  needed this wave. Every other <def> referenced (Body, Stomach, Heart, Lung,
  Kidney, Liver, Neck, Head, Brain, Eye, Ear, Nose, AnimalJaw, Tail, Spine,
  Leg, Paw, Skull) is vanilla Core, confirmed against the same file read
  directly (RimSage is blind to this donor, per the 2026-09-12 sweep note).
  HeadAttackTool / Teeth groups on Beldon's Head/AnimalJaw parts stay bare
  (vanilla groups, not Mlie content).

  Boma/Borcatu/CanCell pass (2026-09-12, next-3 batch): Boma's custom `Boma`
  BodyDef needed a defName rename PLUS repointing its 2 horn parts and their
  attack-tool groups to the ALREADY-PORTED Wave B BodyPartDefs/Groups
  (RSW_SW_LeftHorn/RSW_SW_RightHorn, RSW_SWHornAttackTool) and its tail
  group to RSW_SWTailAttackTool — no new body part needed. Its `Tusk` part
  and `TuskAttackTool` group are vanilla Core, left bare. Borcatu's custom
  `Borcatu` BodyDef is, like Anooba, entirely vanilla-part composition (Tail,
  Spine, Stomach, Heart, Lung x2, Kidney x2, Liver, Neck/Head/Skull/Brain/
  Eye x2/Ear/Nose/AnimalJaw, 4x Leg/Paw) — defName rename only. CanCell's
  custom `CanCell` BodyDef needed a defName rename plus repointing its 2
  wing parts to the ALREADY-PORTED Wave B RSW_SW_LeftWing/RSW_SW_RightWing —
  every other part (Shell, Tail, Stomach, Heart, Pronotum, InsectHead, Brain,
  Eye, Antenna, InsectNostril, InsectMouth, InsectLeg) is vanilla Core.
-->
